19:39.150 --> 19:44.281
You have a lot of good qualities
that I don't have. That's true.

19:44.355 --> 19:45.223
It's true!

19:45.223 --> 19:46.157
Huh?

19:46.157 --> 19:48.092
You're right, Miss Miyamoto!

19:48.092 --> 19:50.194
Now that I've eaten the chips
I feel a little better!

19:50.194 --> 19:52.997
That's right! Being clumsy
can be a talent, can't it?

19:52.997 --> 19:55.934
What? Um, I guess...

19:55.934 --> 19:57.936
Thank you, Miss Miyamoto!

19:57.936 --> 19:59.927
Hey, don't run! It's dangerous!

20:04.309 --> 20:06.277
I should've opened the door, huh?

20:07.078 --> 20:09.513
I guess it's all right, since she feels better.

20:10.448 --> 20:13.440
Man, she ate the whole thing.

20:15.086 --> 20:17.956
I guess I have to prepare
for the worst already, huh?

20:17.956 --> 20:18.787
